{"id":"aaf81cfd5ab654f8","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/updating-the-tax-treatment-of-certain-lease-and-leaseback-arrangements","title":"Updating the tax treatment of certain lease and leaseback arrangements","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28T18:20:58.537Z","text":"The measure restores the intended tax treatment of certain lease and leaseback arrangements by expanding the definition of a finance lease to include a right-of-use lease which would previously have been a finance lease.","changeNote":"First published.","firstPublished":"2026-10-28T17:35:04+00:00","updated":"2026-10-28T17:35:04+00:00","attachments":[{"title":"Amendments to leasing anti-avoidance legislation","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/updating-the-tax-treatment-of-certain-lease-and-leaseback-arrangements/amendments-to-leasing-anti-avoidance-legislation"},{"title":"Draft legislation","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6ae094f6e4367e5c8b046760/Finance_leasebacks_right_of_use_leases.pdf"},{"title":"Explanatory note","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6ae0957e16428df5376061f3/EN_Finance_leasebacks_right_of_use_leases.odt"}]}